f1d-A — the status surface, verbatim, after the fix.
Produced by the same probes native/status_truth_test.sh uses: a real mktemp git
project + a real mktemp RABADON_DIR per case, `rabadon status|on|off` through
native/rabadon-cli.sh, then ONE real PreToolUse event (`git push --force origin
main`) through native/rabadon-gate in the same instant, then `--statusline`.
The statusline is shown through `cat -v`, so ^[ is the real ESC byte.

The claim to read this against:
  ON     -> gate exit 2, non-empty output
  WATCH  -> gate exit 0, non-empty output
  SILENT -> gate exit 0, ZERO bytes

==============================================================
CASE: MUTER 1 of 3 — RABADON_OFF=1 in the environment   (machine mode=enforce)
  project = /tmp/f1d-ekran.3gD09j/c1/proj
  home    = /tmp/f1d-ekran.3gD09j/c1/rd
==============================================================
--- $ rabadon status
rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
  silenced by: RABADON_OFF=1 (environment variable)
    next: unset RABADON_OFF
  read from: /tmp/f1d-ekran.3gD09j/c1/rd/mode (not consulted — a silencer above answers first)
    (exit 0)
--- the REAL gate, same instant, same inputs:
    gate exit=0  bytes=0
--- $ rabadon-gate --statusline
^[[38;5;245mOpus · proj^[[0m  ^[[38;5;245m* rabadon off^[[0m

--- $ rabadon on
rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
  silenced by: RABADON_OFF=1 (environment variable)
    next: unset RABADON_OFF
  the mode underneath is now `enforce`, but nothing will be refused while the silencer above is in place.
    (exit 0)
--- the REAL gate, same instant, same inputs:
    gate exit=0  bytes=0
--- $ rabadon-gate --statusline
^[[38;5;245mOpus · proj^[[0m  ^[[38;5;245m* rabadon off^[[0m

--- $ rabadon off
rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
  silenced by: RABADON_OFF=1 (environment variable)
    next: unset RABADON_OFF
  the mode underneath is now `watch`, but nothing is evaluated at all while the silencer above is in place.
    (exit 0)
--- the REAL gate, same instant, same inputs:
    gate exit=0  bytes=0
--- $ rabadon-gate --statusline
^[[38;5;245mOpus · proj^[[0m  ^[[38;5;245m* rabadon off^[[0m

